To install macOS, start mac: OpenCore boots its installer into macOS Recovery. If the VM's disk is new, open Disk Utility, erase it (QEMU HARDDISK Media) as APFS and quit Disk Utility. Then pick Reinstall macOS. Once macOS is installed, eject the installer (reims-ctl eject mac) and set Metal's error mode (README).
created. Next: macbox up, then open the screen and install macOS (macbox next shows each step).
